<style>
.policy-hero { background: var(--color-bg-alt); padding: var(--space-8) 0; text-align: center; border-bottom: 1px solid var(--color-border); }
        .policy-container { max-width: 750px; margin: 0 auto; padding: var(--space-6) var(--space-3); }
        .policy-container h2 { font-size: var(--font-size-lg); margin: var(--space-5) 0 var(--space-2); }
        .policy-container p, .policy-container li { color: var(--color-text-muted); font-size: var(--font-size-sm); line-height: 1.7; }
        .policy-container ul { padding-left: var(--space-4); margin-bottom: var(--space-3); }
        .policy-container li { margin-bottom: var(--space-1); }
        .shipping-table { width: 100%; border-collapse: collapse; margin: var(--space-3) 0; font-size: var(--font-size-sm); }
        .shipping-table th, .shipping-table td { padding: 12px 16px; border: 1px solid var(--color-border); text-align: left; }
        .shipping-table th { background: var(--color-bg-alt); font-weight: 600; }
        .highlight-box { background: #e8f5e9; border-radius: var(--radius-sm); padding: var(--space-3); margin: var(--space-3) 0; }
</style>

<section class="policy-hero"><h1 class="text-3xl mb-2">Shipping Policy</h1><p class="text-muted">Fast, reliable delivery — right to your door.</p></section>

    <div class="policy-container">
        <div class="highlight-box"><p style="margin:0;color:var(--color-text);"><strong>🎉 FREE shipping</strong> on all US orders over $150!</p></div>

        <h2>Processing Time</h2>
        <p>All orders are processed within <strong>1–2 business days</strong> (Monday–Friday, excluding holidays). You will receive a shipping confirmation email with tracking information once your order has shipped.</p>

        <h2>Domestic Shipping (US)</h2>
        <table class="shipping-table">
            <thead><tr><th>Method</th><th>Estimated Delivery</th><th>Cost</th></tr></thead>
            <tbody>
                <tr><td>Standard Shipping</td><td>5–7 business days</td><td>$5.99 (Free over $150)</td></tr>
                <tr><td>Express Shipping</td><td>2–3 business days</td><td>$14.99</td></tr>
                <tr><td>Overnight Shipping</td><td>1 business day</td><td>$24.99</td></tr>
            </tbody>
        </table>

        <h2>International Shipping</h2>
        <table class="shipping-table">
            <thead><tr><th>Region</th><th>Estimated Delivery</th><th>Cost</th></tr></thead>
            <tbody>
                <tr><td>Canada</td><td>7–10 business days</td><td>$12.99</td></tr>
                <tr><td>Europe (UK, EU)</td><td>10–14 business days</td><td>$19.99</td></tr>
                <tr><td>Australia / Asia</td><td>12–18 business days</td><td>$24.99</td></tr>
                <tr><td>Rest of World</td><td>14–21 business days</td><td>$29.99</td></tr>
            </tbody>
        </table>
        <p><em>Note: International customers may be responsible for customs duties and import taxes levied by their country.</em></p>

        <h2>Order Tracking</h2>
        <p>Once shipped, you'll receive an email with your tracking number. You can also track your order on our <a href="/pages/track" class="link">Track Order</a> page.</p>

        <h2>Shipping Issues</h2>
        <ul>
            <li><strong>Lost packages:</strong> If your tracking shows delivered but you haven't received it, please wait 48 hours then <a href="/pages/contact" class="link">contact us</a>.</li>
            <li><strong>Damaged packages:</strong> Take photos and contact us within 48 hours of delivery for a replacement.</li>
            <li><strong>Address changes:</strong> Contact us immediately after placing your order. We cannot modify the address once shipped.</li>
        </ul>

        <div class="text-center mt-6"><p class="text-muted text-sm">Last updated: March 2026</p><a href="/pages/contact" class="btn btn-outline mt-2">Questions? Contact Us</a></div>
    </div>